---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="wr-hero">
  <div class="wr-hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="wr-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="wr-hero-content container">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--red)">Alabama Veteran Initiative</div>
    <h1>WARRIOR<br /><span class="red">RETREAT</span><br />PROGRAMS</h1>
    <p>find purpose after service</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 14px">
      The Alabama Veteran Warrior Retreat is designed to help veterans struggling with PTSD,
      anxiety, depression, and other combat-related issues. It's a four-day deep dive that guides
      vets to go deep into themselves, helps them understand their issues and gives them guidance
      and skills that leads to successful outcomes. More than 6,000 veterans died by their own hand
      in 2022. Warrior Retreat exists to reduce that number.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap">
      <a href={`${base}warrior-retreat-application/`} class="btn-r">Apply for a Retreat</a><a
        href="mailto:info@alabamaveteran.org"
        class="btn-ow"
        data-contact>Contact Us</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
